# --- Secrets (dotenvx) ---
# `.env` is committed ENCRYPTED (values are ciphertext, safe to publish).
# NEVER commit the private keys (`.env.keys`) or any plaintext variant.
.env.keys
.env.*
!.env.example
*.key
*.agekey

